{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":19,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 19:1"},"Better ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the poor that walketh in his integrity, than ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he that is"]}," perverse in his lips, and is a fool. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 19:2"},"Also, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," the soul ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["be"]}," without knowledge, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it is "]},"not good; and he that hasteth with ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," feet sinneth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 19:3"},"The foolishness of man perverteth his way: and his heart fretteth against the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 19:4"},"Wealth maketh many friends; but the poor is separated from his neighbour. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 19:5"},"A false witness shall not be unpunished, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he that"]}," speaketh lies shall not escape. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 19:6"},"Many will intreat the favour of the prince: and every man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is "]},"a friend to him that giveth gifts. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 19:7"},"All the brethren of the poor do hate him: how much more do his friends go far from him? he pursueth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["them with"]}," words, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["yet"]}," they ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," wanting ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["to him. "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 19:8"},"He that getteth wisdom loveth his own soul: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he that"]}," keepeth understanding shall find good. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 19:9"},"A false witness shall not be unpunished, and he that speaketh lies shall perish. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 19:10"},"Delight is not seemly for a fool; much less for a servant to have rule over princes. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 19:11"},"The discretion of a man deferreth his anger; and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it is"]}," his glory to pass over a transgression. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 19:12"},"The king’s wrath ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," as the roaring of a lion; but his favour ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," as dew upon the grass. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 19:13"},"A foolish son ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the calamity of his father: and the contentions of a wife ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," a continual dropping. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 19:14"},"House and riches ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," the inheritance of fathers and a prudent wife ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," from the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 19:15"},"Slothfulness casteth into a deep sleep; and an idle soul shall suffer hunger. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 19:16"},"He that keepeth the commandment keepeth his own soul; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but "]},"he that despiseth his ways shall die. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 19:17"},"He that hath pity upon the poor lendeth unto the LORD; and that which he hath given will he pay him again. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 19:18"},"Chasten thy son while there is hope, and let not thy soul spare for his crying. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 19:19"},"A man of great wrath shall suffer punishment: for if thou deliver ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["him,"]}," yet thou must do it again. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 19:20"},"Hear counsel, and receive instruction, that thou mayest be wise in thy latter end. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 19:21"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["There are"]}," many devices in a man’s heart; nevertheless the counsel of the LORD, that shall stand. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 19:22"},"The desire of a man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," his kindness: and a poor man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," better than a liar. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 19:23"},"The fear of the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["tendeth"]}," to life: and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he that hath it"]}," shall abide satisfied; he shall not be visited with evil. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 19:24"},"A slothful ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," hideth his hand in ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," bosom, and will not so much as bring it to his mouth again. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 19:25"},"Smite a scorner, and the simple will beware: and reprove one that hath understanding, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," he will understand knowledge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 19:26"},"He that wasteth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," father, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," chaseth away ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," mother, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a son that causeth shame, and bringeth reproach. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 19:27"},"Cease, my son, to hear the instruction ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that causeth"]}," to err from the words of knowledge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 19:28"},"An ungodly witness scorneth judgment: and the mouth of the wicked devoureth iniquity. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PRO 19:29"},"Judgments are prepared for scorners, and stripes for the back of fools. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 19:29"}]}]}
